{"id":"november","lemma":"November","pos":"noun","rank":3183,"glosses":["November (the eleventh month of the Gregorian calendar, following October and preceding December)"],"ipa":"/noˈfɛmbɐ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/9f/De-November.ogg/De-November.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Novembers","plural":"November"},"formAudio":{"Novembers":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/85/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Sebastian_Wallroth-Novembers.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Die Wahl war im November.","en":"The election was in November.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"choice, selection"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"in the"},null]},{"text":"Der Vertrag wurde am 18. November 1903 unterzeichnet.","en":"The treaty was signed on November 18, 1903.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"contract, agreement"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"at the / on the"},null,{"g":"to sign","l":"unterzeichnen"}]},{"text":"Die Amerikaner wählten am 2. November 2004.","en":"Americans voted on November 2, 2004.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"American )"},{"g":"to choose, to select","l":"wählen"},{"g":"at the / on the"},null]},{"text":"Es ist schon November, aber es hat noch nicht geschneit.","en":"It's already November, but it hasn't snowed yet.","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"already"},null,{"g":"but"},{"g":"it"},{"g":"has","l":"haben"},null,null,{"g":"to snow","l":"schneien"}],"phrases":[[7,9,"not yet"]]},{"text":"In Tokio beginnt die kalte Jahreszeit Mitte November.","en":"In Tokyo, the cold season starts in the middle of November.","words":[{"g":"in"},null,{"g":"to begin","l":"beginnen"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"cold, chilly","l":"kalt"},{"g":"season, time of year"},{"g":"middle"},null]}]}